---

---

<section class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden border-y border-white/5">
    <div
        class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] -z-10"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <!-- v1.0 Public Beta badge -->
        <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-500/5 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-medium mb-6"
        >
            <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                <span
                    class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75"
                ></span>
                <span
                    class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-cyan-500"
                ></span>
            </span>
            v1.0 Public Beta
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold font-heading text-white mb-4">
            Built in the open
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Stratum is brand new. We're shipping in public beta and refining
            the platform week by week — no inflated metrics, no fake
            testimonials, just a tool we're building alongside our first users.
            <span class="text-slate-200"
                >Join the first users and help shape the product.</span
            >
        </p>

        <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4"
        >
            <a
                href="https://console.stratum-app.com/signup"
                class="px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 text-slate-300 text-sm font-bold hover:text-white hover:border-white transition-all"
            >
                Start Free
            </a>
            <a
                href="/changelog"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors group"
            >
                Follow our changelog
                <span
                    class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"
                    >&rarr;</span
                >
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
